OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FOne or two
OL,6,Fshowers continuing this evening and
OL,7,Fovernight, but remaining dry for most
OL,8,Fwith some clear spells. Temperatures
OL,9,Fmainly remaining in double figures but
OL,10,Ffeeling cooler than the previous
OL,11,Fnight. Winds easing.
OL,12,
OL,13,CThursday:FA few showers around first
OL,14,Fthing on Thursday, but these will
OL,15,Fquickly fade leaving a largely dry day
OL,16,Fwith sunny spells. Lighter winds than
OL,17,FWednesday with temperatures around
OL,18,Faverage.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
