OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRemaining
OL,6,Fdry and bright on Friday and Saturday
OL,7,Fwith temperatures also increasing. A
OL,8,Frisk of some showers on Sunday but
OL,9,Fstaying dry and warm for most.
